The public source tree does not include the Archicad Development Kit or other
large binary dependencies. tools/build/provision-reference.ps1 downloads the
declared build and test dependencies from the authorities recorded in
AddOn/reference/CATALOG.yaml. Those dependencies remain under their respective
upstream licenses and notices.

Notable upstream components used by the build include:

- Graphisoft Archicad API Development Kit
- Diligent Engine
- cpp-httplib
- MessagePack for C/C++
- nanort
- GoogleTest
- CPython
- IcoNoir

The NotebookUI lockfile records the licenses of its JavaScript dependencies.
Check the upstream package metadata before redistributing a modified dependency
bundle.
